WEBVTT

00:01:56.904 --> 00:02:01.409
Somewhere that creates
an immersive and active way

00:02:01.409 --> 00:02:03.244
to stay engaged.

00:02:03.286 --> 00:02:06.789
Well, if current predictions come true,

00:02:06.831 --> 00:02:12.545
most of our socializing, work and play
will shift to games,

00:02:12.545 --> 00:02:16.591
virtual spaces and yes, the metaverse.

00:02:17.425 --> 00:02:21.637
And that's where stories will be told
and relationships built.

00:02:22.471 --> 00:02:24.473
So for every human avatar

00:02:24.515 --> 00:02:28.436
that is interacting
or consuming in these spaces,

00:02:28.436 --> 00:02:31.397
let’s have the same
for Mweituria the elephant,